---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import GlowLineSeparator from '@/components/ui/separator/GlowLineSeparator.astro';
const pageTitle = 'About Me';
const pageDescription = 'Learn more about my background in product management, analytics, and growth.';
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} pubDate={new Date()} showHeader={false}>
  <p>
    Hi, I’m Abhishek Saxena — a Product & Analytics professional with 9+ years of experience driving data-informed decisions and building user-centric solutions.
  </p>
  <p>
    I specialize in product strategy, experimentation, cohort analysis, and funnel optimization. I’m skilled in PRD writing, feature prioritization, and cross-functional collaboration to deliver impactful and scalable products.
  </p>
  <p>
    My toolkit spans advanced SQL (BigQuery, PostgreSQL), Python (Pandas, NumPy), A/B testing, behavioral analytics, and dashboarding tools like Looker Studio and Metabase. I’m equally comfortable in Figma prototyping user journeys or deep in data defining instrumentation requirements.
  </p>
  <p>
    Currently at Glance Digital, I’ve launched multiple high-impact features — from Bundles driving 22% deeper sessions, to Quiz Time delivering 2× revenue per Mn impressions. Previously at Chingari, Gameberry Labs, Shadowfax Technologies, and Infosys.
  </p>
  <p>
    I thrive at the intersection of data and product, translating complex metrics into clear decisions that move the needle on growth, retention, and monetization.
  </p>

  <GlowLineSeparator />

</Layout>
